    <item>
      <title>Enumerações</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/disciplinas/poo-1/enums/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/disciplinas/poo-1/enums/</guid>
      <description>
        
        
        &lt;h2&gt;Definição&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;definição&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#defini%c3%a7%c3%a3o&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link permanente para esta seção&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Enumerações&lt;/em&gt; são um tipo especial de classe que define um conjunto finito de objetos imutáveis nomeados, chamado de enumeradores.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Implementação de enumerações no Java&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;implementação-de-enumerações-no-java&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#implementa%c3%a7%c3%a3o-de-enumera%c3%a7%c3%b5es-no-java&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link permanente para esta seção&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;A palavra reservada &lt;code&gt;enum&lt;/code&gt; define o tipo de dados enumeração. Os enumeradores são identificados com todas as letras em caixa alta.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code&#34;&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;background-color:#f7f7f7;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-java&#34; data-lang=&#34;java&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#cf222e&#34;&gt;public&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#fff&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#cf222e&#34;&gt;enum&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#fff&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Prioridade&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#fff&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#fff&#34;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;BAIXA&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#fff&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#fff&#34;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;MEDIA&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#fff&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#fff&#34;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;ALTA&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#fff&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#fff&#34;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;URGENTE&lt;span style=&#34;color:#fff&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0&#34;&gt;
  &lt;button
    class=&#34;hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50&#34;
    title=&#34;Copiar código&#34;
    aria-label=&#34;Copiar código&#34;
    data-copied-label=&#34;Copiado!&#34;
  &gt;
    &lt;div class=&#34;hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cada enumerador possui como tipo a própria enumeração. Assim, o tipo do enumerador &lt;code&gt;BAIXA&lt;/code&gt; é &lt;code&gt;Prioridade&lt;/code&gt;. Ao ser convertido para texto, o enumerador produz seu próprio nome.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code&#34;&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;background-color:#f7f7f7;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-java&#34; data-lang=&#34;java&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Prioridade&lt;span style=&#34;color:#fff&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;p&lt;span style=&#34;color:#fff&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#0550ae&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#fff&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Prioridade&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;BAIXA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#fff&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#fff&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#57606a&#34;&gt;// BAIXA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#fff&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;System&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;out&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;println&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;p&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0&#34;&gt;
  &lt;button
    class=&#34;hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50&#34;
    title=&#34;Copiar código&#34;
    aria-label=&#34;Copiar código&#34;
    data-copied-label=&#34;Copiado!&#34;
  &gt;
    &lt;div class=&#34;hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Um enumerador não pode ser instanciado com o operador &lt;code&gt;new&lt;/code&gt;. O valor de uma variável deve ser definida a partir do objeto constante na enumeração. Como cada enumerador possui uma única instância, é seguro compará-los com o operador  &lt;code&gt;==&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code&#34;&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;background-color:#f7f7f7;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-java&#34; data-lang=&#34;java&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Prioridade&lt;span style=&#34;color:#fff&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;p&lt;span style=&#34;color:#fff&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#0550ae&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#fff&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Prioridade&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;ALTA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#fff&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#fff&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#cf222e&#34;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;p&lt;span style=&#34;color:#fff&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#0550ae&#34;&gt;==&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#fff&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Prioridade&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;ALTA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;){&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#fff&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#fff&#34;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;System&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;out&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;println&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#0a3069&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;A prioridade é alta&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#fff&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0&#34;&gt;
  &lt;button
    class=&#34;hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50&#34;
    title=&#34;Copiar código&#34;
    aria-label=&#34;Copiar código&#34;
    data-copied-label=&#34;Copiado!&#34;
  &gt;
    &lt;div class=&#34;hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Método values&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;método-values&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#m%c3%a9todo-values&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link permanente para esta seção&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;O método &lt;code&gt;values&lt;/code&gt;  retorna um arranjo contendo todos os enumeradores definidos na enumeração.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code&#34;&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;background-color:#f7f7f7;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-java&#34; data-lang=&#34;java&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#cf222e&#34;&gt;for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#cf222e&#34;&gt;var&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#fff&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;enumerador&lt;span style=&#34;color:#fff&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#fff&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Prioridade&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;()){&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#fff&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#fff&#34;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;System&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;out&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;println&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;enumerador&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#fff&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0&#34;&gt;
  &lt;button
    class=&#34;hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50&#34;
    title=&#34;Copiar código&#34;
    aria-label=&#34;Copiar código&#34;
    data-copied-label=&#34;Copiado!&#34;
  &gt;
    &lt;div class=&#34;hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Método valueOf&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;método-valueof&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#m%c3%a9todo-valueof&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link permanente para esta seção&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;O método &lt;code&gt;valueOf&lt;/code&gt;  retorna o enumerador cujo nome corresponde à &lt;code&gt;String&lt;/code&gt; informada por parâmetro.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code&#34;&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;background-color:#f7f7f7;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-java&#34; data-lang=&#34;java&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#cf222e&#34;&gt;var&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#fff&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;prioridade&lt;span style=&#34;color:#fff&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#0550ae&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#fff&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Prioridade&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;valueOf&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#0a3069&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;ALTA&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#fff&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;System&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;out&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;println&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;prioridade&lt;span style=&#34;color:#1f2328&#34;&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0&#34;&gt;
  &lt;button
    class=&#34;hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50&#34;
    title=&#34;Copiar código&#34;
    aria-label=&#34;Copiar código&#34;
    data-copied-label=&#34;Copiado!&#34;
  &gt;
    &lt;div class=&#34;hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Caso não existir uma enumeração que corresponde à &lt;code&gt;String&lt;/code&gt; informada por parâmetro, uma exceção será lançada.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Construtores, atributos e métodos&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;construtores-atributos-e-métodos&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#construtores-atributos-e-m%c3%a9todos&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link permanente para esta seção&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;As enumerações podem possuir construtores, atributos e métodos assim como as outras classes. Os construtores de uma enumeração são privados e não podem ser invocados diretamente com o operador &lt;code&gt;new&lt;/code&gt;. Quando a enumeração define um construtor com parâmetros, é necessário informar os valores correspondentes para cada enumerador.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code&#34;&gt;

